{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/sendapp_row

    A person: their picture, their name, how they stand and, if a link can go to them, its button, which sends at once.
    Under the name, small, «Clear the PIN» for someone with a PIN who forgot it and cannot get it back by e-mail.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * picture - Their picture, 35 px.
    * name, state, label - Their name, their state and what it says.
    * cansend, sendurl, sendto, sesskey, sendtext, again - The button; again is for a link already on its way.
    * haspin - They have a PIN the school can clear (by POST to sendurl, with resetpin and the session key).
    * fixurl, fixtext - What to do about a person who cannot be sent a link (an e-mail missing), if there is something.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "picture": "",
        "name": "Mateo Ruiz",
        "state": "waiting",
        "label": "No link yet",
        "cansend": true,
        "sendurl": "#",
        "sendto": 2,
        "sesskey": "abc",
        "sendtext": "Send",
        "again": false,
        "haspin": true
    }
}}
<li class="local-oksigeniaaty-send-row" data-state="{{state}}">
    {{{picture}}}
    <div class="local-oksigeniaaty-send-who">
        <b id="local-oksigeniaaty-send-u{{sendto}}">{{name}}</b>
        {{#label}}<span class="local-oksigeniaaty-send-state">{{label}}</span>{{/label}}
        {{#haspin}}
        <form method="post" action="{{sendurl}}" class="local-oksigeniaaty-send-pin">
            <input type="hidden" name="resetpin" value="{{sendto}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-link" aria-describedby="local-oksigeniaaty-send-u{{sendto}}">{{#str}} sendapp:clearpin, local_oksigeniaaty {{/str}}</button>
        </form>
        {{/haspin}}
    </div>
    {{#cansend}}
    <form method="post" action="{{sendurl}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="sendto" value="{{sendto}}">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm {{#again}}btn-outline-secondary{{/again}}{{^again}}btn-outline-primary{{/again}}" aria-describedby="local-oksigeniaaty-send-u{{sendto}}">{{sendtext}}</button>
    </form>
    {{/cansend}}
    {{#fixurl}}<a class="local-oksigeniaaty-send-fix" href="{{fixurl}}">{{fixtext}}</a>{{/fixurl}}
</li>
